      "text": "atomic workouts\n\nSTYLE\nthe style resembles retrofuturistic terminals \nfrom 80ies scifi movies like blade runner and alien\n\n\n\nCONCEPT\nworkouts that make it easy to show up.\njust start a tiny work out in between. \nmake the first little step to forming a habit.\nand stick to it every day.\njump on the page and press play. done.",
      "fontSize": 68.58381088264426,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "atomic workouts\n\nSTYLE\nthe style resembles retrofuturistic terminals \nfrom 80ies scifi movies like blade runner and alien\n\n\n\nCONCEPT\nworkouts that make it easy to show up.\njust start a tiny work out in between. \nmake the first little step to forming a habit.\nand stick to it every day.\njump on the page and press play. done.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
